  "limitations": [
    "The research is exploratory and does not explicitly study the role of design and styling in altering emotional states.",
    "The study did not definitively determine the underlying reasons for the consistent preference for wood-based rooms, only proposing stress counteraction and bringing nature indoors as possibilities."
